OL,3,GNEWSAAberystwyth University pauses #43m
OL,4,AOld College upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to turn the first home of the
OL,7,FUniversity of Wales into a tourist
OL,8,Fdestination in a #43m renovation
OL,9,Fincluding a four-star hotel and museum
OL,10,Fhave been paused.
OL,12,FAberystwyth University said it was
OL,13,Freviewing rising costs to make its
OL,14,FGrade I listed Old College building
OL,15,Fsafe and weatherproof with the
OL,16,Frestoration of 664 window frames and
OL,17,F20,000 slates.
OL,19,F"The review will consider future costs,
OL,20,Ffunding and the most appropriate
OL,21,Ftimeline for the remaining work," it
OL,22,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,433,430,260,140,0,100
