OL,3,GNEWSAAberystwyth University pauses #43m
OL,4,AOld College upgrade
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe first phase of the project was to
OL,7,Finclude a science exhibition, business
OL,8,Funits and 10 function rooms in what the
OL,9,Funiversity hoped would create 130 jobs
OL,10,Fand draw 200,000 visitors a year.
